  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.17 - Updated dependency\n\t\t\tv1.0.16 - Added XrmtoolBox dependency\n\t\t\tv1.0.15 - Fixed target path\n\t\t\tv1.0.14 - Fixed dependency to use correct XrmToolBox package name, major cleanup removed 50+ unnecessary packages and references\n\t\t\tv1.0.13 - CRITICAL FIX: Changed target folder from 'plugins' to 'Plugins' (capital P) as required by XrmToolBox for Tool Library discovery\n\t\t\tv1.0.12 - Fixed XrmToolBox dependency version to use minimum version range for better compatibility, fixed README path\n\t\t\tv1.0.11 - Fixed package to include only plugin DLL (excluded SDK assemblies)\n\t\t\tv1.0.10 - Updated XrmToolBox dependency to Minimum version for Tool Library compatibility\n\t\t\tv1.0.9 - Cleaned up plugin metadata, ensured Tool Library compatibility\n\t\t\tv1.0.8 - Updated XrmToolBox target path,\n\t\t\tv1.0.7 - Updated XrmToolBox dependency to latest version for Tool Library compatibility latest version\n\t\t\tv1.0.6 - Updated XrmToolBox dependency to latest version for Tool Library compatibility latest version\n\t\t\tv1.0.5 - Updated XrmToolBox dependency to latest version for Tool Library compatibility\n\t\t\tv1.0.4 - Fixed NuGet package discovery for XrmToolBox Tool Library, removed old logo and added new plugin icon\n\t\t\tv1.0.3 - Added XrmToolBox dependency, fixed TreeView for BU hierarchy, added plugin icon with Base64 encoding\n\t\t\tv1.0.2 - Updated target framework to net48, fixed README\n\t\t\tv1.0.1 - Added README to package\n\t\t\tv1.0.0 - Initial Release",
